  m_Text: Are you kidding ??? What the **** are you talking about man ? Why are trush
    talking my music?!! I am Officially inviting you to OTB blitz match with the
    Prize fund! Both of us will invest 5000$ and loser takes it all! I suggest all
    other people who's interested in this situation, just take a look at my results
    in 2016 and 2017 Blitz World championships, and that should be enough... No need
    to listen for every laughing babe, TudorTales Games is always play Fair !
