  m_Text: 'The default resolution is HD.

    The default game FPS is capped at 60.

    I
    will update the settings in the Gama version.

    This is the placeholder.

    Also,
    why don''t you like the textures?!

    Be brave, be honest to yourself and start
    this wisdom talkings!!! Everybody know that i am very bad blitz player, I can
    lose to anyone in the world in single game! And "w"esley "s"o is somebody for
    me, just a player who are laughing every single time when winning, (remember
    what you say about Firouzja ) !!!'
